    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: a40cf0d516474e3f884c9ea463aad00e
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A shambling horde member (husks, zombies, drones — any faction''s mindless dead): it shuffles closer only while you look away, lurches forward anyway when stared at too long, lunges the moment you turn your back or reload, and claws when in reach. Frightening in numbers: you can''t watch them all.'
        _children:
        - e431e74d0d934d95bac1691516e31293
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: e431e74d0d934d95bac1691516e31293
        _position: {x: 0, y: 150}
        _comment: 'Lunge at an opening, claw in reach, otherwise shamble in'
        _children:
        - 4b0068bb245c40cea2ea359da5db9761
